**/target/
**/.git/
**/.DS_Store
**/tmp/
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp

# Native library binaries are gitignored (see .gitignore) but, without .git in
# the Docker build context, the pdfium_provenance working-tree scan would find a
# locally-present libpdfium.dylib and false-fail (issue #56 guard). Keep native
# libs out of the build context entirely so the provenance test stays honest and
# the pre-push hook does not need --no-verify.
*.dylib
*.so
*.dll
*.a
*.lib
libpdfium*
